    "text": "By Kaira Willis ,\n6 hours ago FRANKLIN COUNTY, Va. (WDBJ) - With employment being a concern among young people, a new proposed Career & Technical Education Center in Rocky Mount has officially been given the green light. The center would provide hands-on training and real-world experience to prepare students for specific careers after graduation. WDBJ7 spoke... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
